# Stack (trust AGENTS.md)

This repo is a **frontend**. Commerce is remote.

| What | Where |
|---|---|
| Site | https://www.soulminerseden.com |
| Dev | `cd frontend && npm run dev` |
| Medusa | Railway `https://backend-production-2bafd.up.railway.app` |
| Browser API | `/api/medusa` (same-origin proxy) |

**Lies on disk — ignore them:**

- `docker-compose.yml` builds `./backend` — that folder is gone
- `ROADMAP.md`, `TODO-NEXT-SESSION.md`, `SESSION_SUMMARY.md` are 2026-02 leftovers
- `.env.example` still lists Stripe keys. Checkout is pay-at-pickup.

Do not `docker-compose up`. Do not stand up localhost:9000. Do not restore a local Medusa to "make cart work."
